stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> DRAFT
  DRAFT --> QUOTED: quote attached
  QUOTED --> PENDING_APPROVAL: request approval
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED: parent approves
  APPROVED --> SUBMITTED: system submits
  SUBMITTED --> SETTLED: signed webhook
  SUBMITTED --> FAILED: signed webhook
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED: parent or reviewer rejects
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> DRAFT: quote expired
  APPROVED --> CANCELLED: parent cancels
  SETTLED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  note right of CANCELLED
    A parent can also cancel from
    DRAFT, QUOTED and PENDING_APPROVAL.
    A QUOTED payment also returns to DRAFT
    when its quote expires.
  end note
